{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "description": "GS1 payloads and what the parser must return. payload is the scanner text (GS = \\u001d). expect is {gtin (GTIN-14), symbology (dataMatrix|ean13), expiry, lot, serial} or {error: empty|tooLong|invalidCharacters|missingGTIN|invalidGTIN}. expiry is {year, month, day|null} (day null = month precision, GS1 DD=00), \"missing\", or {invalid: invalidMonth|invalidDay|invalidFormat}. lot/serial are null when absent or dropped (over 20 characters or outside GS1 character set 82). shape is the payload structure without any value (prefix, FNC1, AIs with the length of variable fields, GS, ?(n) = unknown AI followed by n characters, EAN13).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "full DataMatrix with ]d2 and GS after the lot",
      "payload": "]d2010340093000001417270300101A2B3C\u001d21XYZ123456789",
      "shape": "]d2 01 17 10(6) GS 21(12)",
      "expect": {
        "gtin": "03400930000014",
        "symbology": "dataMatrix",
        "expiry": {
          "year": 2027,
          "month": 3,
          "day": null
        },
        "lot": "1A2B3C",
        "serial": "XYZ123456789"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "same payload without symbology identifier",
